/msid-133055093,imgsize-59334.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US Democrats eye probes into Trump-linked firms over impeachment if they regain House control: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133052422.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a significant move, US House Democrats are gearing up for extensive investigations into the business practices of the Trump administration. Their strategy involves utilizing hearings and subpoenas to scrutinize decisions made that may have led to personal gains. Major corporations such as Apple and Alphabet might find themselves under examination for their regulatory and contractual engagements.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-democrats-eye-probes-into-trump-linked-firms-over-impeachment-if-they-regain-house-control-report/articleshow/133052422.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-democrats-eye-probes-into-trump-linked-firms-over-impeachment-if-they-regain-house-control-report/articleshow/133052422.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T18:19:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133052987,imgsize-190534.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A Swedish couple moved into the dream home in Malmö; three years later, they left it behind for a rural home in Japan]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133053755.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After recently selling their newly constructed home in Sweden, a Swedish couple has made the bold decision to embrace a fresh start by purchasing an empty residence in Japan. This significant change stems from their evolving family aspirations and a burgeoning affection for Asia. They are now excited to undertake renovations on their Japanese abode while immersing themselves in the enchanting culture and scenery of Japan.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/travel/in-2023-a-swedish-couple-moved-into-the-dream-home-they-built-near-malm-three-years-later-they-left-it-behind-for-a-49000-rural-home-in-japan/articleshow/133053755.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/travel/in-2023-a-swedish-couple-moved-into-the-dream-home-they-built-near-malm-three-years-later-they-left-it-behind-for-a-49000-rural-home-in-japan/articleshow/133053755.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T19:04:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133053761,imgsize-122425.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[ICE rolls out body cameras, but policy lets agency decide which footage goes public ]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133054441.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-to-provide-body-cameras-but-policy-allows-footage-release-only-in-agencys-best-interests/articleshow/133054441.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-to-provide-body-cameras-but-policy-allows-footage-release-only-in-agencys-best-interests/articleshow/133054441.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T20:14:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133054639,imgsize-110176.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Flesh-eating bacteria kill 5 in Louisiana, health officials warn beachgoers as all cases are linked to seawater]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace