/133052352.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Democrats introduced a resolution to end unauthorized US military involvement against Iran. Senator John Hickenlooper leads the effort, citing constitutional war powers. This move escalates a congressional challenge to President Donald Trump's handling of the conflict. Military leaders privately advise seeking an off-ramp from ongoing air operations. President Trump expresses confidence that the confrontation could end soon.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/end-this-war-senate-democrats-turn-up-heat-on-donald-trump-seek-end-to-unauthorised-iran-hostilities/articleshow/133052352.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/end-this-war-senate-democrats-turn-up-heat-on-donald-trump-seek-end-to-unauthorised-iran-hostilities/articleshow/133052352.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T18:00:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133052819,imgsize-623260.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A new Kansas law now bars students from accessing phones, earbuds and smartwatches all school day]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133050817.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Many states are banning smartphones in schools due to growing distractions and health concerns.  Some districts now restrict student phone access from morning bell to afternoon dismissal.  Parents are increasingly supporting these bans, citing research and developmental appropriateness.  Concerns also focus on excessive screen time and inappropriate content accessed on school devices.  Schools are now reviewing technology policies and limiting device usage during non-instructional periods.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/a-new-kansas-law-bars-students-from-accessing-phones-earbuds-and-smartwatches-all-school-day-while-one-parent-group-is-pushing-for-tighter-ipad-limits/articleshow/133050817.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/a-new-kansas-law-bars-students-from-accessing-phones-earbuds-and-smartwatches-all-school-day-while-one-parent-group-is-pushing-for-tighter-ipad-limits/articleshow/133050817.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T16:17:38+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133050842,imgsize-103867.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[American entrepreneur says 'I'm shocked but honestly not surprised' as US plans to remove 60-day grace period for H-1Bs]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133052455.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/american-entrepreneur-says-im-shocked-but-honestly-not-surprised-as-us-plans-to-remove-60-day-grace-period-for-h-1bs/articleshow/133052455.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/american-entrepreneur-says-im-shocked-but-honestly-not-surprised-as-us-plans-to-remove-60-day-grace-period-for-h-1bs/articleshow/133052455.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-08T17:37:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133052486,imgsize-829693.cms"/></item></channel></rss>